<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: Dismembered
</h4>

<p>
Brilliant story, Tom. To a certain extent, it's a collection of oddities until the end, when you tie together that these old-timers are doing the same thing they did long ago. Did you see the story that way, when you went up there? Did you know what you had? Why did you want to go to begin with?<br />
<br />
Just fantastic.
</p>
